{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G3-01","example":{"issue":{"title":"無號誌四岔路口，路權與行車邊界是否清楚？","intro":"主要道路約 15 m、次要道路約 8 m，部分路段兼供路側停車。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-01-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-01-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"缺少主次道路提示","text":"主要道路缺少提醒駕駛留意次要道路來車的警示。"},{"id":"space","title":"外側行車與停車混用","text":"外側空間同時供車輛行駛與停車，邊界不明確。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限提示不足","text":"兩條道路皆缺少清楚的速限標字與標誌。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[56,57],"strategy":{"title":"以交錯車道整理低速街道","intro":"結合車道橫移、交錯停車與停讓提示，回應市區路側活動需求。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-01-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"offset","title":"用車道橫移提醒減速","text":"採交錯車道配置，搭配本例30 km/h速限，提醒駕駛注意路口與行人。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"parking","title":"配合動線交錯設置停車格","text":"將停車格沿路段單邊交錯配置，明確區分停車與行車範圍。","moduleId":"M1-03"},{"id":"guidance","title":"說清路口停讓與續行路徑","text":"搭配停讓設施、慢行提示及路口行車導引線，銜接前後車道。","moduleId":"M2-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-3-01-unsignalized-urban-orthogonal-cross.typ","sha256":"eea5b0d69bef27202fc63448a5a043d9901454245292c451f0aa44db696136b4","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g3-01-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況圖_01.png","width":3479,"height":2300,"label":"G3-01 現況圖","scenario":"G3-01","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":56,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image52.png","sha256":"bd9a78c7f084656db56c7069f6703df825735e3b9deecbe773d7aac6e5aca1ae"},"results:g3-01-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-01/G3-01_現況照片_01.png","width":2526,"height":1386,"label":"G3-01 現況照片","scenario":"G3-01","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":57,"sourcePart":"ppt/med